{
  "declaredLength": 2648,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오! 너는 지난번에 그 트레이너 아니냐!\n지금은 다른 영화를 찍는 중이란다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C62400210020B108B2940020C9C0B09CBC88C5D00020ADF80020D2B8B808C774B1080020C544B2C8B0D00021000AC9C0AE08C7400020B2E4B9780020C601D654B97C0020CC0DB2940020C911C774B780B2E4002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번 작품의 테마는 호러!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC880020C791D488C7580020D14CB9C8B2940020D638B7EC002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "숲의 요괴라 불리는 공포의 포켓몬\n대로트를 촬영할 예정이란다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C232C7580020C694AD34B77C0020BD88B9ACB2940020ACF5D3ECC7580020D3ECCF13BAAC000AB300B85CD2B8B97C0020CD2CC601D5600020C608C815C774B780B2E4002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만 야생 포켓몬은 무섭단 말이지...\n심지어 고스트타입이기까지 하고...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC7400020BB34C12DB2E80020B9D0C774C9C0002E002E002E000AC2ECC9C0C5B40020ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785C774AE30AE4CC9C00020D558ACE0002E002E002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 말인데,\n이번에도 협조해 줄 수 있을까?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020B9D0C778B370002C000AC774BC88C5D0B3C40020D611C870D5740020C9040020C2180020C788C744AE4C003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대로트는\n야생에서 보기 힘들다더구나.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300B85CD2B8B294000AC57CC0DDC5D0C11C0020BCF4AE300020D798B4E4B2E4B354AD6CB098002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "13번인가 15번 와일드 존에 있다는\n소문은 들었다만...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00310033BC88C778AC00002000310035BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D00020C788B2E4B294000AC18CBB38C7400020B4E4C5C8B2E4B9CC002E002E002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 나목령에서 진화시키는\n방법도 있긴 하지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020B098BAA9B839C5D0C11C0020C9C4D654C2DCD0A4B294000ABC29BC95B3C40020C788AE340020D558C9C0002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼, 협조해 줄 거라면\n밤에 대로트를 데리고 와 주렴!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC002C0020D611C870D5740020C9040020AC70B77CBA74000ABC24C5D00020B300B85CD2B8B97C0020B370B9ACACE00020C6400020C8FCB834002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "촬영에 협조해 줄 거라면\n대로트를 지닌 포켓몬에 넣고 밤에 오렴!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD2CC601C5D00020D611C870D5740020C9040020AC70B77CBA74000AB300B85CD2B8B97C0020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE00020BC24C5D00020C624B834002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대로트를 데려왔구나!\n촬영에 협조해 줄 마음이 든 거니?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n촬영은 밤에 시작하니까, 밤에 다시 오렴!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300B85CD2B8B97C0020B370B824C654AD6CB0980021000ACD2CC601C5D00020D611C870D5740020C9040020B9C8C74CC7740020B4E00020AC70B2C8003F00100001BE00000ACD2CC601C7400020BC24C5D00020C2DCC791D558B2C8AE4C002C0020BC24C5D00020B2E4C2DC0020C624B834002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "또 촬영 중단인가 보죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B6100020CD2CC6010020C911B2E8C778AC000020BCF4C8E0003F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호러 신...\n심장이 두근거려요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638B7EC0020C2E0002E002E002E000AC2ECC7A5C7740020B450ADFCAC70B824C694002E002E002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대로트를 데려왔구나.\n촬영에 협조해 줄 거니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300B85CD2B8B97C0020B370B824C654AD6CB098002E000ACD2CC601C5D00020D611C870D5740020C9040020AC70B2C8003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "협조해 드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D611C870D5740020B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠시만요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0C2DCB9CCC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬만이 가진\n그 특유의 박력이 필요한데...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACB9CCC7740020AC00C9C4000AADF80020D2B9C720C7580020BC15B825C7740020D544C694D55CB370002E002E002E002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 믿을 건 너밖에 없다니까!\n좋아, 촬영을 시작해 볼까!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020BBFFC7440020AC740020B108BC16C5D00020C5C6B2E4B2C8AE4C0021000AC88BC544002C0020CD2CC601C7440020C2DCC791D5740020BCFCAE4C002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다들 준비됐지!?\n레디... 액션!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B4E40020C900BE44B410C9C00021003F000AB808B514002E002E002E0020C561C158002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기... 유령이 나오는 건 아니죠?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30002E002E002E0020C720B839C7740020B098C624B2940020AC740020C544B2C8C8E0003F00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "걱정하지 말라니까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC71C815D558C9C00020B9D0B77CB2C8AE4C002100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠시만요...\n방금 무슨 소리 들리지 않았어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0C2DCB9CCC694002E002E002E000ABC29AE080020BB34C2A80020C18CB9AC0020B4E4B9ACC9C00020C54AC558C5B4C694003F00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그랬나?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ACB098003F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호, 호헤...!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638002C0020D638D5E4002E002E002E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꺄아아아악!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE84C544C544C544C5450021002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...어라?\n하나도 안 무섭네요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EC5B4B77C003F000AD558B098B3C40020C5480020BB34C12DB124C694002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컷!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEF700210021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저렇게 붙임성 좋은 숲의 요괴가\n세상에 어디 있어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B807AC8C0020BD99C784C1310020C88BC7400020C232C7580020C694AD34AC00000AC138C0C1C5D00020C5B4B5140020C788C5B4002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러고 보니, 대로트는 숲에 사는 생물한테\n매우 상냥하다고 들었어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECACE00020BCF4B2C8002C0020B300B85CD2B8B2940020C232C5D00020C0ACB2940020C0DDBB3CD55CD14C000AB9E4C6B00020C0C1B0E5D558B2E4ACE00020B4E4C5C8C5B4C694002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "혹시... 저희도 숲에 사는 친구라고\n생각하고 있는 거 아닐까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D639C2DC002E002E002E0020C800D76CB3C40020C232C5D00020C0ACB2940020CE5CAD6CB77CACE0000AC0DDAC01D558ACE00020C788B2940020AC700020C544B2D0AE4CC694003F00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐야!? 친구에게만 보여 주는\n고스트타입의 상냥함이라니...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50C57C0021003F0020CE5CAD6CC5D0AC8CB9CC0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCB294000AACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785C7580020C0C1B0E5D568C774B77CB2C8002E002E002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 또한 포켓몬에 대한 진실!\n영화로 만들 가치는 충분하겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020B610D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B300D55C0020C9C4C2E40021000AC601D654B85C0020B9CCB4E40020AC00CE58B2940020CDA9BD84D558ACA0C5B4002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "중요한 건 영상! 부연 설명 없이도\n감동을 주는 영상을 만들 수만 있다면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n각본쯤이야 얼마든지 고쳐 주지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C911C694D55C0020AC740020C601C0C100210020BD80C5F00020C124BA850020C5C6C774B3C4000AAC10B3D9C7440020C8FCB2940020C601C0C1C7440020B9CCB4E40020C218B9CC0020C788B2E4BA7400100001BE00000AAC01BCF8CBE4C774C57C0020C5BCB9C8B4E0C9C00020ACE0CCD00020C8FCC9C0002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 세상에서 오직 나만이... 대로트의 진실과\n그 심연을 아는 사람이 되는 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C138C0C1C5D0C11C0020C624C9C10020B098B9CCC774002E002E002E0020B300B85CD2B8C7580020C9C4C2E4ACFC000AADF80020C2ECC5F0C7440020C544B2940020C0ACB78CC7740020B418B2940020AC70C57C002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "각본은 영화의 설계도 같은 건데\n영상을 위해 막 고쳐도 되는 걸까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC01BCF8C7400020C601D654C7580020C124ACC4B3C40020AC19C7400020AC74B370000AC601C0C1C7440020C704D5740020B9C90020ACE0CCD0B3C40020B418B2940020AC78AE4CC694003F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대로트, 자세히 보니\n눈빛이 상냥하더라구요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
